    scene v103 with Dissolve(2)
    a "They were inseparable, Sol and Sirius."
    scene v104 with Dissolve(1)
    a "Sol had apparently been a temple maiden at Helios's temple in Kalytro before she became a ninja."
    a "She was crazy about Sirius... Her family should've been sworn to serve Athena's temple there, but she decided to devote herself to Helios's instead."
    a "Weirdly enough, she never even spoke to Sirius there... She was too shy to approach Helios's demi-god son leading the temple. She was just a humble temple maiden there, after all."
    scene v105 with Dissolve(1)
    a "She used to tell me all kinds of stuff like this after she came here... She and I were good friends."
    a "She was a year older than me, but she never acted like it really..."
    scene v1020 with Dissolve(1)
    z "..."
    z "What do you mean WERE good friends?"
    z "Did something happen?"
    a "..."
    scene v1021 with dissolve
    a "Well, yes..."
    scene v106 with Dissolve(2)
    a "You see, back when Sol was still in Kalytro working at Helios's temple, Athena had learnt about Sol picking another god's temple over hers..."
    a "In families sworn to care for temples, only one family member had to attend to the temple's needs, and Sol's father was still working at Athena's temple. So Athena had no right to object..."
    scene v107 with Dissolve(1)
    a "Rather than punish Sol's family by cursing them or something, she demanded that Sol's father should work twice as much as he used to."
    a "But he was just a feeble old man. Even though he told Sol he'd be fine... He wasn't... He got more and more sickly..."
    a "And a few weeks after Sirius left the temple to join the ninja village, Sol's father died..."
    scene v108 with Dissolve(1)
    a "Sol had lost almost everything she cared about. Her father was dead and Sirius was gone."
    a "Suddenly the life she was longing for faded away."
    z "..."
    scene v109 with Dissolve(1)
    a "In vengeance for her father, she burnt down Athena's temple in the night and fled the city."
    z "She..."
    scene v1019 with Dissolve(2)
    a "Yeah... She came here to the ninja village to find Sirius."
    scene v1010 with Dissolve(2)
    a "And she became a ninja. She was very good at it really. Got promoted really fast."
    scene v1011 with Dissolve(1)
    a "And most importantly, she got to talk to Sirius... Get to know him for the first time..."
    a "They became good friends in no time. She worked extra hard to keep up with him, get promoted as fast as she could, so they'd go on missions together."
    a "That meant that those two were always together. After a while the two became a couple."
    scene v1019 with Dissolve(2)
